{"seq":3,"slug":"aberrations","title":"像差与光学校正","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/lens-optics/aberrations","wordCount":1898,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"像差与光学校正\">像差与光学校正</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>理想透镜将物点精确成像为像点，但真实光学系统永远存在像差（Aberration）——入射光线不会完美汇聚于一点。像差是影响镜头画质的根本因素，也是镜头设计师需要在焦距、光圈、体积、成本之间反复权衡的核心难题。本文系统分类讲解各种像差的物理成因及现代校正技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Optical Aberrations&lt;br/&gt;光学像差&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Monochromatic&lt;br/&gt;单色像差&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Chromatic&lt;br/&gt;色差&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Spherical&lt;br/&gt;球差&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Coma&lt;br/&gt;彗差&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;Astigmatism&lt;br/&gt;像散&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;Field Curvature&lt;br/&gt;场曲&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; H[&quot;Distortion&lt;br/&gt;畸变&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; I[&quot;Longitudinal CA&lt;br/&gt;轴向色差&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; J[&quot;Lateral CA&lt;br/&gt;横向色差&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Optical Aberrations&lt;br/&gt;光学像差\"] --&gt; B[\"Monochromatic&lt;br/&gt;单色像差\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Chromatic&lt;br/&gt;色差\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Spherical&lt;br/&gt;球差\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Coma&lt;br/&gt;彗差\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"Astigmatism&lt;br/&gt;像散\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"Field Curvature&lt;br/&gt;场曲\"]\n    B --&gt; H[\"Distortion&lt;br/&gt;畸变\"]\n    C --&gt; I[\"Longitudinal CA&lt;br/&gt;轴向色差\"]\n    C --&gt; J[\"Lateral CA&lt;br/&gt;横向色差\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>像差是真实光学系统无法回避的物理现实，可以按来源与可校正性来组织：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>五种赛德尔单色像差</strong>：球差、彗差、像散、场曲、畸变，各自按离轴距离与光圈大小主导不同的画面区域。</li>\n<li><strong>色差分两类</strong>：轴向色差（LoCA）随波长改变焦距，横向色差（TCA）随波长改变放大率，前者表现为焦外紫边/绿边，后者表现为边角红青条纹。</li>\n<li><strong>校正材料与面型</strong>：消色差/复消色差胶合、ED/萤石玻璃、衍射光学元件、非球面镜片是主要手段。</li>\n<li><strong>MTF 是综合量化</strong>：调制传递函数描述对比度随空间频率的传递能力，10 lp/mm 与 30 lp/mm 分别对应&quot;通透感&quot;与分辨率。</li>\n<li><strong>光学 vs 数字校正</strong>：球差、彗差、轴向色差等信息损失不可后期恢复，畸变、暗角、横向色差则可交给机身修正。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"赛德尔五种单色像差\">赛德尔五种单色像差</h2><p>1856 年，Ludwig von Seidel 将三阶像差分为五种基本类型。它们按照离轴距离和光圈大小的不同组合，各自主导不同的画面区域。</p>\n<h3 id=\"球面像差-spherical-aberration\">球面像差（Spherical Aberration）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：球面透镜的边缘部分比中心部分折射力更强，导致不同高度入射的光线汇聚于不同位置。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta l&#x27; = -\\frac{h^2}{2f}\\left(\\frac{1}{n} - 1\\right) \\cdot k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4411em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>球差随光线高度的平方增大，因此在大光圈时尤为明显。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>球差状态</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>画面效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正球差（欠矫）</td>\n<td>边缘光汇聚在焦点前</td>\n<td>焦点柔和、散景奶油化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零球差（完美校正）</td>\n<td>各高度光线等焦</td>\n<td>最大锐度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负球差（过矫）</td>\n<td>边缘光汇聚在焦点后</td>\n<td>散景出现硬边&quot;洋葱圈&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>校正方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>非球面镜片——直接改变边缘曲率，精确消除球差</li>\n<li>光圈收缩——物理截断边缘光线（代价是通光量降低）</li>\n<li>正负透镜组合——利用凹透镜的反向球差抵消</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"彗差-coma\">彗差（Coma）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：离轴光束经过透镜后，不同环带的光线聚焦于不同位置，形成彗星状拖尾。</p>\n<p>彗差在画面边缘最为明显，其大小正比于离轴角度和光圈面积。表现为边角的点光源呈现&quot;鸟翼形&quot;或&quot;V 字形&quot;拖影。</p>\n<p><strong>校正方法</strong>：满足阿贝正弦条件（Abbe Sine Condition）可同时消除球差和彗差——满足此条件的光学系统称为&quot;等晕系统&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"像散-astigmatism\">像散（Astigmatism）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：离轴物点发出的光束在子午面（经线面）和弧矢面（纬线面）内具有不同的焦距，导致焦点位置分离。</p>\n<p>像散使得画面边缘的点光源在两个正交方向上分别达到最佳聚焦——在一个方向清晰时另一个方向模糊。表现为边角区域的径向线和切向线不能同时清晰。</p>\n<h3 id=\"场曲-field-curvature\">场曲（Field Curvature）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：即使每个像点都完美聚焦，但焦点分布不在平面上而在曲面上（佩兹瓦尔场曲面）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{R_{Petzval}} = \\sum_i \\frac{1}{n_i f_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5991em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于传感器是平面的，场曲导致画面中心对焦时边缘模糊，或边缘对焦时中心失焦。</p>\n<p><strong>校正方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>正负镜片组合（使佩兹瓦尔和为零）</li>\n<li>场平镜/场镜设计</li>\n<li>数码后期的场曲校正（有限效果）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"畸变-distortion\">畸变（Distortion）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：放大率随像高变化，使直线成像为曲线。畸变不影响清晰度，只影响几何形状。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>畸变类型</th>\n<th>放大率变化</th>\n<th>视觉效果</th>\n<th>常见于</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>桶形畸变</td>\n<td>边缘放大率递减</td>\n<td>直线外凸</td>\n<td>广角镜头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枕形畸变</td>\n<td>边缘放大率递增</td>\n<td>直线内凹</td>\n<td>长焦镜头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复合畸变</td>\n<td>先增后减</td>\n<td>&quot;髭须形&quot;弯曲</td>\n<td>某些变焦镜头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>畸变的数学描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&#x27; = r(1 + k_1 r^2 + k_2 r^4 + \\ldots)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0141em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0141em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1 &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为桶形畸变，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1 &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为枕形畸变。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Barrel Distortion&lt;br/&gt;桶形畸变&lt;br/&gt;Wide-angle&quot;] ~~~ B[&quot;No Distortion&lt;br/&gt;无畸变&lt;br/&gt;Ideal&quot;] ~~~ C[&quot;Pincushion&lt;br/&gt;枕形畸变&lt;br/&gt;Telephoto&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Barrel Distortion&lt;br/&gt;桶形畸变&lt;br/&gt;Wide-angle\"] ~~~ B[\"No Distortion&lt;br/&gt;无畸变&lt;br/&gt;Ideal\"] ~~~ C[\"Pincushion&lt;br/&gt;枕形畸变&lt;br/&gt;Telephoto\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"色差\">色差</h2><h3 id=\"轴向色差-longitudinal-chromatic-aberration-loca\">轴向色差（Longitudinal Chromatic Aberration, LoCA）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：玻璃的折射率随波长变化（色散），短波光（蓝/紫）折射率高于长波光（红），导致不同颜色的光汇聚在不同距离上。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f = f \\cdot \\frac{1}{V_d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1574em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为阿贝数（Abbe Number），值越大色散越小。</p>\n<p>轴向色差表现为：大光圈时焦外区域出现紫边（前景）或绿边（背景）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"横向色差-lateral-chromatic-aberration-tca\">横向色差（Lateral Chromatic Aberration, TCA）</h3><p><strong>物理成因</strong>：不同波长光的放大率不同，导致画面边缘彩色像点不重合。</p>\n<p>横向色差表现为边角高对比边缘出现红/青色条纹——可通过后期软件校正（因为是位置偏移，非失焦模糊）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"色差校正技术\">色差校正技术</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消色差双胶合（Achromat）</td>\n<td>正冕牌玻璃 + 负火石玻璃</td>\n<td>两波长同焦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复消色差（Apochromat）</td>\n<td>加入萤石/ED 玻璃</td>\n<td>三波长同焦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超低色散玻璃（UD/ED/SLD）</td>\n<td>高阿贝数材料</td>\n<td>显著减小色散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衍射光学元件（DO/PF）</td>\n<td>利用衍射的反色散</td>\n<td>色差与体积同时减小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字校正</td>\n<td>机身处理器实时修正</td>\n<td>消除残余 TCA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mtf-曲线-像差的综合量化\">MTF 曲线——像差的综合量化</h2><h3 id=\"mtf-的定义\">MTF 的定义</h3><p>调制传递函数（Modulation Transfer Function）量化镜头在不同空间频率下的对比度传递能力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"2.4em\" maxsize=\"2.4em\">∣</mo><mtext>output</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MTF(f) = \\frac{I_{max} - I_{min}}{I_{max} + I_{min}} \\bigg|_{\\text{output}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5858em;vertical-align:-1.1358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.5692em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">output</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想镜头在所有频率下 MTF = 1（完美传递），实际镜头随频率升高而 MTF 下降。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mtf-曲线解读\">MTF 曲线解读</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线特征</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>视觉对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10 lp/mm 高</td>\n<td>高对比度</td>\n<td>&quot;通透感&quot;强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30 lp/mm 高</td>\n<td>高分辨率</td>\n<td>细节丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S/M 线分离大</td>\n<td>像散严重</td>\n<td>径向/切向不均</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘骤降</td>\n<td>场曲或彗差</td>\n<td>边角画质差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"现代镜头的像差控制策略\">现代镜头的像差控制策略</h2><h3 id=\"光学校正-vs-数字校正\">光学校正 vs 数字校正</h3><p>现代无反系统采用&quot;光学+数字&quot;协同策略：镜头负责不可逆损失的校正（球差、色差导致的信息丢失），机身负责可逆的几何修正（畸变、暗角、横向色差）。</p>\n<p>这意味着现代镜头设计可以适当放松畸变和暗角指标，将设计余量用于提升中心锐度和大光圈像质——因为这些指标无法靠后期弥补。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可数字校正</th>\n<th>不可数字校正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>畸变</td>\n<td>球差模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗角</td>\n<td>彗差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>横向色差</td>\n<td>轴向色差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>像散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>焦外品质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>像差是真实光学系统无法回避的物理现实。五种赛德尔像差加上色差，构成了影响镜头画质的完整图谱。现代镜头设计通过特殊材料（ED 玻璃、萤石）、特殊面型（非球面、衍射面）和数字校正的组合，在体积、成本与画质之间寻求最优平衡。理解像差的物理本质，你就能透过 MTF 曲线和样片分析，做出超越营销话术的理性镜头选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"像差与光学校正","id":"像差与光学校正"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"赛德尔五种单色像差","id":"赛德尔五种单色像差"},{"level":3,"text":"球面像差（Spherical Aberration）","id":"球面像差-spherical-aberration"},{"level":3,"text":"彗差（Coma）","id":"彗差-coma"},{"level":3,"text":"像散（Astigmatism）","id":"像散-astigmatism"},{"level":3,"text":"场曲（Field Curvature）","id":"场曲-field-curvature"},{"level":3,"text":"畸变（Distortion）","id":"畸变-distortion"},{"level":2,"text":"色差","id":"色差"},{"level":3,"text":"轴向色差（Longitudinal Chromatic Aberration, LoCA）","id":"轴向色差-longitudinal-chromatic-aberration-loca"},{"level":3,"text":"横向色差（Lateral Chromatic Aberration, TCA）","id":"横向色差-lateral-chromatic-aberration-tca"},{"level":3,"text":"色差校正技术","id":"色差校正技术"},{"level":2,"text":"MTF 曲线——像差的综合量化","id":"mtf-曲线-像差的综合量化"},{"level":3,"text":"MTF 的定义","id":"mtf-的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"MTF 曲线解读","id":"mtf-曲线解读"},{"level":2,"text":"现代镜头的像差控制策略","id":"现代镜头的像差控制策略"},{"level":3,"text":"光学校正 vs 数字校正","id":"光学校正-vs-数字校正"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"焦距与光圈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/lens-optics/focal-length-aperture"},"next":{"title":"CMOS 与 CCD 传感器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/optics-basics/sensor-technology/cmos-ccd-sensors"}}